WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.751 --> 00:00:06.423
They spent what, a trillion dollars
trying to get one dude back from Mars?

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:09.092
You get the opportunity
to bring back Matt Damon.

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:11.386
I just don't think we should
wait around to be saved, you know?

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.847
You really don't think
they're sending anybody to save us?

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:15.473
I mean...

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.562
In case you haven't noticed,

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:23.314
we're doomed to spend the rest
of our miserable lives on this ship.

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:24.733
Maybe we should do it.

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:25.483
Do what?

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:26.192
It.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.820
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:32.866
We're not attracted now but,
we would emotionally attach.

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:34.200
You mean fall in love.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.537
What if this awesome
thing we have going on

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.872
gets ruined?

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.248
People are meant to be together.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.292
Oh, sorry, is this...
is this on?

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.586
Okay, ehm... lame.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.298
We're both married.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:51.551
I'm sure being adrift in space
gives you a hall pass.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:00.060
You know what you
want to watch tonight?

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:00.769
&lt;i&gt;Alien?&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:01.770
Never seen it.

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:05.940
Why the hell did we
watch that movie?

